{"engine": "piper", "lines": [{"t": 0.3, "end": 7.363, "text": "¡Qué onda, pilotos! Soy Maurito, el piloto número dos. ¿Te cuesta adelantar en las carreras? ¡Hoy te enseño!", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Qué", "t": 0.3, "end": 0.46}, {"w": "onda,", "t": 0.46, "end": 0.74}, {"w": "pilotos!", "t": 1.06, "end": 1.62}, {"w": "Soy", "t": 1.92, "end": 2.12}, {"w": "Maurito,", "t": 2.12, "end": 2.62}, {"w": "el", "t": 3.08, "end": 3.2}, {"w": "piloto", "t": 3.2, "end": 3.54}, {"w": "número", "t": 3.54, "end": 3.74}, {"w": "dos.", "t": 3.74, "end": 4.16}, {"w": "¿Te", "t": 4.4, "end": 4.56}, {"w": "cuesta", "t": 4.56, "end": 4.94}, {"w": "adelantar", "t": 4.94, "end": 5.44}, {"w": "en", "t": 5.44, "end": 5.54}, {"w": "las", "t": 5.54, "end": 5.66}, {"w": "carreras?", "t": 5.66, "end": 6.16}, {"w": "¡Hoy", "t": 6.5, "end": 6.66}, {"w": "te", "t": 6.66, "end": 6.8}, {"w": "enseño!", "t": 6.8, "end": 7.22}]}, {"t": 7.813, "end": 16.226, "text": "¡Paso número uno! Pégate atrás del kart de adelante en la recta. Él rompe el aire, y tú ganas velocidad. Eso se llama rebufo.", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Paso", "t": 7.813, "end": 8.133}, {"w": "número", "t": 8.133, "end": 8.313}, {"w": "uno!", "t": 8.313, "end": 8.693}, {"w": "Pégate", "t": 8.973, "end": 9.253}, {"w": "atrás", "t": 9.253, "end": 9.633}, {"w": "del", "t": 9.633, "end": 9.833}, {"w": "kart", "t": 9.833, "end": 10.073}, {"w": "de", "t": 10.073, "end": 10.273}, {"w": "adelante", "t": 10.273, "end": 10.753}, {"w": "en", "t": 11.133, "end": 11.293}, {"w": "la", "t": 11.293, "end": 11.413}, {"w": "recta.", "t": 11.413, "end": 11.873}, {"w": "Él", "t": 12.133, "end": 12.253}, {"w": "rompe", "t": 12.253, "end": 12.633}, {"w": "el", "t": 12.633, "end": 12.753}, {"w": "aire,", "t": 12.753, "end": 12.993}, {"w": "y", "t": 12.993, "end": 13.473}, {"w": "tú", "t": 13.473, "end": 13.633}, {"w": "ganas", "t": 13.633, "end": 14.033}, {"w": "velocidad.", "t": 14.033, "end": 14.473}, {"w": "Eso", "t": 14.973, "end": 15.153}, {"w": "se", "t": 15.153, "end": 15.333}, {"w": "llama", "t": 15.333, "end": 15.573}, {"w": "rebufo.", "t": 15.573, "end": 16.073}]}, {"t": 16.676, "end": 21.222, "text": "¡Paso número dos! Antes de la curva, sal del rebufo y ponte por dentro.", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Paso", "t": 16.676, "end": 16.956}, {"w": "número", "t": 16.956, "end": 17.116}, {"w": "dos!", "t": 17.116, "end": 17.516}, {"w": "Antes", "t": 17.776, "end": 18.036}, {"w": "de", "t": 18.036, "end": 18.236}, {"w": "la", "t": 18.236, "end": 18.336}, {"w": "curva,", "t": 18.336, "end": 18.756}, {"w": "sal", "t": 18.936, "end": 19.236}, {"w": "del", "t": 19.236, "end": 19.416}, {"w": "rebufo", "t": 19.416, "end": 19.996}, {"w": "y", "t": 19.996, "end": 20.216}, {"w": "ponte", "t": 20.216, "end": 20.496}, {"w": "por", "t": 20.496, "end": 20.676}, {"w": "dentro.", "t": 20.676, "end": 20.956}]}, {"t": 21.622, "end": 28.121, "text": "¡Paso número tres! Frena un poquito más tarde que él, pero siempre en línea recta, y quédate con el vértice.", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Paso", "t": 21.622, "end": 21.882}, {"w": "número", "t": 21.882, "end": 22.102}, {"w": "tres!", "t": 22.102, "end": 22.502}, {"w": "Frena", "t": 22.842, "end": 23.182}, {"w": "un", "t": 23.182, "end": 23.442}, {"w": "poquito", "t": 23.442, "end": 23.722}, {"w": "más", "t": 23.722, "end": 24.062}, {"w": "tarde", "t": 24.062, "end": 24.402}, {"w": "que", "t": 24.402, "end": 24.602}, {"w": "él,", "t": 24.602, "end": 24.782}, {"w": "pero", "t": 24.922, "end": 25.042}, {"w": "siempre", "t": 25.042, "end": 25.542}, {"w": "en", "t": 25.542, "end": 25.782}, {"w": "línea", "t": 25.782, "end": 26.002}, {"w": "recta,", "t": 26.002, "end": 26.622}, {"w": "y", "t": 26.622, "end": 26.882}, {"w": "quédate", "t": 26.882, "end": 27.202}, {"w": "con", "t": 27.202, "end": 27.402}, {"w": "el", "t": 27.402, "end": 27.542}, {"w": "vértice.", "t": 27.542, "end": 27.922}]}, {"t": 28.571, "end": 34.519, "text": "¡Ojo! Si tu kart no llega a la altura de sus llantas de atrás, no te metas. Ahí vienen los choques.", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Ojo!", "t": 28.571, "end": 28.871}, {"w": "Si", "t": 29.111, "end": 29.311}, {"w": "tu", "t": 29.311, "end": 29.431}, {"w": "kart", "t": 29.431, "end": 29.711}, {"w": "no", "t": 29.711, "end": 30.131}, {"w": "llega", "t": 30.131, "end": 30.471}, {"w": "a", "t": 30.471, "end": 30.571}, {"w": "la", "t": 30.571, "end": 30.651}, {"w": "altura", "t": 30.651, "end": 30.871}, {"w": "de", "t": 30.871, "end": 31.111}, {"w": "sus", "t": 31.111, "end": 31.251}, {"w": "llantas", "t": 31.251, "end": 31.651}, {"w": "de", "t": 31.651, "end": 31.831}, {"w": "atrás,", "t": 31.831, "end": 32.111}, {"w": "no", "t": 32.371, "end": 32.471}, {"w": "te", "t": 32.471, "end": 32.591}, {"w": "metas.", "t": 32.591, "end": 33.031}, {"w": "Ahí", "t": 33.271, "end": 33.491}, {"w": "vienen", "t": 33.491, "end": 33.751}, {"w": "los", "t": 33.751, "end": 33.911}, {"w": "choques.", "t": 33.911, "end": 34.271}]}, {"t": 34.969, "end": 40.125, "text": "Recuerda: rebufo, por dentro, y frena recto. ¡Con práctica vas a pasar a todos!", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "Recuerda:", "t": 34.969, "end": 35.549}, {"w": "rebufo,", "t": 35.769, "end": 36.269}, {"w": "por", "t": 36.269, "end": 36.469}, {"w": "dentro,", "t": 36.469, "end": 36.749}, {"w": "y", "t": 36.749, "end": 37.309}, {"w": "frena", "t": 37.309, "end": 37.629}, {"w": "recto.", "t": 37.629, "end": 38.069}, {"w": "¡Con", "t": 38.229, "end": 38.369}, {"w": "práctica", "t": 38.369, "end": 38.829}, {"w": "vas", "t": 38.829, "end": 39.049}, {"w": "a", "t": 39.049, "end": 39.169}, {"w": "pasar", "t": 39.169, "end": 39.409}, {"w": "a", "t": 39.409, "end": 39.589}, {"w": "todos!", "t": 39.589, "end": 39.809}]}, {"t": 40.475, "end": 41.729, "text": "¡Nos vemos en la pista!", "who": "maurito", "words": [{"w": "¡Nos", "t": 40.475, "end": 40.655}, {"w": "vemos", "t": 40.655, "end": 40.915}, {"w": "en", "t": 40.915, "end": 41.155}, {"w": "la", "t": 